A plugin resource directory that holds the module's resources output, as the root module's own
directory does, is refused rather than copied into itself.
--- task
:project:compileJvm
--- project.yaml
modules:
  - tools/whole
plugins:
  - ./tools/whole
--- tools/whole/module.yaml
product: jvm/amper-plugin
--- tools/whole/plugin.yaml
tasks:
  declare:
    action: !org.example.build.declareResources
      resourceDir: ${module.rootDir}
generated:
  resources:
    - directory: ${tasks.declare.action.resourceDir}
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
plugins:
  whole: enabled
--- src/Lib.kt
object Lib
--- krusty-refusal
error	ERROR: the resource directory `<directory>/project` of module `project` holds its resources output `<directory>/project/build/artifacts/CompiledJvmArtifact/projectjvm/resources-output`, and krusty-toolchain does not copy a directory into itself
